* A constant before (pc) (an equate, also one further on, an expression of them), not a label:
* both r68s take it for the displacement itself, as a number (lea Disp(pc),a0, Disp an equate of
* $10: $41FA $0010); as took it for address $10. In the index form too, and after a movem mask or
* a bit number. An equate of a label stays an address.
* fixed: e29666f 2026-10-13 r68togas: a constant before (pc) is the displacement, as both r68s; equates further on count
* expect text: 4e714e71 41fa0010 43fb0010 4cfa00030012 083a00010020 45faffea 4e714e71
Disp equ $10
 psect pc_const,0,0,0,0,0
 nop
lab nop
 lea Disp(pc),a0
 lea Disp(pc,d0.w),a1
 movem.l Disp+2(pc),d0-d1
 btst #1,Later(pc)
 lea Addr(pc),a2
 nop
Later equ Disp*2
Addr equ lab+2
 ends
